to come!!!<br><br><br><strong>Upcoming during Early Access_</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756150/extras/6aa8042be49a072e625caf79c2097c19.avif?t=1671278375\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756150/extras/7ea39eae729010ae42c17a444fe89fce.avif?t=1671278375\" /></div><br><br><br><br>The release will be in early access with several changes during the Development process.<br><br>Visual Software Support<br>NVIDIA\u00ae DLSS and Reflex Support<br>AMD\u00ae FidelityFX Super-Resolution (FSR)<br>Ultra-wide support<br>DLSS and Fidelity are scalable by the Player.<br>Will be Updated to <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong> as soon as possible",
